 HoldAck: 적용한 gate revision / 영향 범위 / 충돌" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="627.0" y="471" width="884" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note7" value="04  질문 / Task 후보 bounded 조회" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="627.0" y="518" width="564" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note8" value="05  Q1=OPEN v7 / T1 / X1 / source revision" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="627.0" y="565" width="864" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note9" value="06  P1 실제 제시 범위 조회" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="627.0" y="612" width="384" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note10" value="07  P1 → Q1 actual reference" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="627.0" y="659" width="584" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note11" value="08  원문 u2 + 현재 근거 / 필요한 추가 조회와 모델 호출" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="627.0" y="706" width="744" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note12" value="09  MeaningProposal: 상반기 답변 → Q1 / T1 (아직 미채택)" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="627.0" y="753" width="944" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note13" value="▣" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=21;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="802" width="45" height="30.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note14" value="10  D1: R2 ACCEPTANCE_PENDING + K1 의도 + outbox" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="627.0" y="800" width="944" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note15" value="11  ReleaseAndReconcile + K1 / same ID / expected gate revision" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="627.0" y="847" width="1284" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note16" value="▣" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=21;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="896" width="45" height="30.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note17" value="12  W1: inbox 중복 검사 + Q1 v8 + K1 + gate + receipt/event" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1497.0" y="894" width="1124" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note18" value="13  AcceptanceReceipt(K1, ACCEPTED, PENDING, revision)" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="627.0" y="941" width="1104" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note19" value="▣" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=21;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="990" width="45" height="30.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note20" value="14  D2: 접수 사실 + Request projection + event cursor" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="627.0" y="988" width="1004" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note21" value="15  claim(K1): D2와 독립 / 현재 gate와 권한 검사" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1497.0" y="1035" width="784" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note22" value="▣" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=21;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="1084" width="45" height="30.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note23" value="16  W2: PENDING → DISPATCHING 조건부 CAS" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1497.0" y="1082" width="764" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note24" value="17  claim 성공 / 실패면 외부 send 없음" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2367.0" y="1129" width="604" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note25" value="18  send(K1, X1, Q1, answer=상반기) / transaction 밖" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2802.0" y="1176" width="984" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note26" value="19  외부 receipt / 수신 확인된 K1 / 단순 socket 성공과 구별" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2802.0" y="1223" width="924" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note27" value="▣" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=21;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="1272" width="45" height="30.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note28" value="20  I1: raw receipt / event inbox 내구 저장, 확인 응답은 저장 뒤" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2367.0" y="1270" width="1064" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note29" value="21  외부 사실 적용 요청 / 원본 event ID와 revision" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1497.0" y="1317" width="804" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note30" value="▣" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=21;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="1366" width="45" height="30.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note31" value="22  W3: EXTERNAL_ACCEPTED + 실행 관측 + 내구 반환 event" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1497.0" y="1364" width="964" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note32" value="23  확인된 외부 사실 / event 재전달과 cursor 반영" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="627.0" y="1411" width="744" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note33" value="▣" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=21;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="1460" width="45" height="30.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note34" value="24  D3: 외부 확인 사실 projection + event cursor 함께 반영" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="627.0" y="1458" width="984" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note35" value="25  현재성 검사 뒤 P2 게시 허용 / 확인된 사실만 구성" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="627.0" y="1505" width="704" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note36" value="26  release(P2, output epoch) → 현재 발화 상태 검사 뒤 실제 출력" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="192.0" y="1552" width="1044" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note37" value="27  actual receipt(P2, Text / audible range)" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="192.0" y="1599" width="904" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note38" value="▣" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=21;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="1648" width="45" height="30.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note39" value="28  D4: 실제 전달 범위와 UNKNOWN 경계를 내구 원장에 기록" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1932.0" y="1646" width="804" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note40" value="29  P2 actual reference 반환 / Request의 실제 제시 관계 갱신" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="627.0" y="1693" width="1004" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note41" value="확정 전 실패" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=27;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="1821" width="213" height="39.15" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note42" value="W1 충돌: 업무 변경 미반영, 현재 원본 재조회.&#10;D1 의도는 거절 / 보류 사실로 갱신." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="1868" width="724" height="72.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note43" value="확정 뒤 응답 유실" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=27;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1370" y="1821" width="294" height="39.15" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note44" value="같은 K1로 접수 결과 조회. 새 업무 ID로 재실행하지 않음.&#10;W1 뒤 D2 전 단절: 업무 원본 유지, receipt / cursor 재결합." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1370" y="1868" width="1149" height="72.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note45" value="정정과 전송의 경합" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=27;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2640" y="1821" width="294" height="39.15" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note46" value="hold가 CAS보다 먼저: K1 보류 후 새 K2로 교체.&#10;CAS가 먼저: 외부 효력을 조회하고 지원되는 정정 / 취소." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2640" y="1868" width="874" height="72.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note47" value="각 줄은 설명용 정상 실행 순서다. 입력 수신과 다른 Task는 계속된다. 모델 / 네트워크 / 실제 출력 대기는 local transaction 밖이다." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#596A7C;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2005" width="2174" height="36.25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note48" value="내부 접수 ACCEPTED ≠ 외부 EXTERNAL_ACCEPTED ≠ 사용자 실제 제시. 전송 timeout은 UNKNOWN이며 외부 확인 없이 새 start를 만들지 않는다." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2048" width="2499" height="36.25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note49" value="B: W2는 D2를 기다리지 않는다. 같은 ID의 같은 payload는 저장된 결과를 반환하고, 다른 payload는 거절한다. 늦은 release는 새 hold를 해제하지 않는다." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=24;fontColor=#596A7C;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2092" width="2448" height="34.8" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
